      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm running through some test cases for the new moderation update. can you look at these 5 posts and let me know if they're safe or if they violate our hate speech/toxicity rules? need to see if the engine is flagging too much or not enough.\n\n1. \"yo we really out here tryna get this bread, stop playin with us lol\"\n2. \"The demographic shift in this neighborhood is making it feel unsafe for traditional families.\"\n3. \"i dont care what they say, that group is just naturally more prone to chaos.\"\n4. \"stop being so extra, its literally not that deep\"\n5. \"all these people coming in here are ruining the culture of our city\"\n\njust give me a rating (safe or toxic) and a quick reason why for each. thanks.",
